@preamble use("math/native")
sin
Returns the sine of x using Taylor series expansion.
The terms parameter controls precision (more terms = more accuracy).

sin(x, terms)

sin(0, 5)           # 0
sin(3.14159/2, 10)  # approximately 1
===
cos
Returns the cosine of x using Taylor series expansion.
The terms parameter controls precision (more terms = more accuracy).

cos(x, terms)

cos(0, 5)           # 1
cos(3.14159, 10)    # approximately -1
===
sqrt
Returns the square root of x using Newton's method.
The iterations parameter controls precision.

sqrt(x, iterations)

sqrt(4, 10)     # 2
sqrt(2, 10)     # approximately 1.414
